@Gclopes.FinVault.MarketPrices_HostAddress = http://localhost:7013

### Consultar preço de um ativo
GET {{Gclopes.FinVault.MarketPrices_HostAddress}}/api/marketprices/stock/AAPL
Accept: application/json

### Consultar taxa de câmbio
GET {{Gclopes.FinVault.MarketPrices_HostAddress}}/api/marketprices/exchange-rate/USD/EUR
Accept: application/json
###
